OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear for 'last piece of
OL,4,Agreen space'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a Kent town are concerned
OL,7,Fthe "last piece of green space" where
OL,8,Fthey live could be sold off by the
OL,9,Fcounty council and lost to housing
OL,10,Fdevelopers.
OL,12,FKent County Council (KCC) is currently
OL,13,F"inviting comments on the proposed
OL,14,Fdisposal" of three acres of open space
OL,15,Fin Riddles Road, Sittingbourne, which
OL,16,Fwas declared surplus in July.
OL,18,FResident Ben Conway told the Local
OL,19,FDemocracy Reporting Service he only
OL,20,Fjust discovered the plans but was clear
OL,21,F"we need to protect this green space".
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
